1
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,833
Dear May Deer,

2
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,667
With a lovely family,

3
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:15,250
Dreaming of growing up each day.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,167
Shy Chuan-Chuan Pangolin,

5
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:18,667
Quiet, with not a word to say,

6
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:21,667
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

7
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:22,333
Curls up like a popcorn ball.

8
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:23,917
Don’t be shy!

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Sing out loud!

10
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:25,833
Sing out loud!

11
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:27,417
Let your imagination shine!

12
00:00:30,667 --> 00:00:31,167
Good friends in the forest,

13
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:33,083
Growing and playing together,

14
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:34,000
Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan!

15
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,333
ODEER MAYO / Happy May Deer and Chuan-Chuan

16
00:00:37,676 --> 00:00:40,082
Halloween Is Here!

17
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:47,333
Hello, children!

18
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,583
Hello, Teacher Capybara!

19
00:00:48,583 --> 00:00:52,667
Next week is Halloween, and we’re having a costume party!

20
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,500
Let’s welcome our performance expert,

21
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,333
Teacher Blue Pheasant!

22
00:00:57,667 --> 00:01:00,333
Hello, everyone! I’m Teacher Blue Pheasant.

23
00:01:00,333 --> 00:01:03,667
Children, that magical time of year is here again!

24
00:01:03,667 --> 00:01:06,250
We’re holding a Halloween costume parade!

25
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:11,083
This time, the theme is to create a costume that best expresses your personality.

26
00:01:11,250 --> 00:01:13,750
I’ll teach you how to walk onstage

27
00:01:13,750 --> 00:01:15,583
and show everyone who you are with confidence.

28
00:01:15,917 --> 00:01:19,083
You can start preparing as soon as you get home today.

29
00:01:21,083 --> 00:01:24,583
The teacher said everyone has to design a Halloween costume.

30
00:01:27,833 --> 00:01:29,083
That means

31
00:01:29,083 --> 00:01:32,583
we can dress up as anything we like!

32
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:34,917
Wow! That sounds like fun!

33
00:01:34,917 --> 00:01:35,333
Mwah!

34
00:01:35,333 --> 00:01:38,000
Little Fox, have you decided what to dress up as?

35
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,750
Hmm, I’ve been thinking.

36
00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:42,167
I’ll probably choose something related to the universe I love.

37
00:01:42,167 --> 00:01:44,333
The universe? You mean outer space?

38
00:01:44,333 --> 00:01:47,583
That’s right! It’s full of mysterious things we haven’t discovered.

39
00:01:48,083 --> 00:01:49,750
That’s so cool!

40
00:01:50,167 --> 00:01:53,000
My costume will probably have something to do with magic.

41
00:01:54,250 --> 00:01:56,833
I have a magic wand that can cast spells!

42
00:01:56,833 --> 00:02:00,333
I-I’m going to dress up as my favorite food!

43
00:02:00,333 --> 00:02:02,000
Just thinking about it makes me hungry!

44
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,417
Haha! Your ideas are so interesting!

45
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:06,000
What about you, Chuan-Chuan?

46
00:02:07,333 --> 00:02:08,917
I’m still thinking.

47
00:02:08,917 --> 00:02:11,667
As long as nobody notices me, I can dress up as anything.

48
00:02:11,917 --> 00:02:14,000
Chuan-Chuan, that’s so you.

49
00:02:14,417 --> 00:02:14,833
What about you, May?

50
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:20,750
You have the best imagination. What do you want to dress up as?

51
00:02:22,167 --> 00:02:25,500
That’s a good question. I’ll have to think about it.

52
00:02:28,167 --> 00:02:29,333
What should I be?

53
00:02:32,083 --> 00:02:32,917
An angel!

54
00:02:33,917 --> 00:02:35,167
None of these seems quite right.

55
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:38,000
Oh, whatever. I’ll try them all first!

56
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:46,083
Ta-da! This is a little ghost who loves flying around at night.

57
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,500
Boo-hoo!

58
00:02:48,417 --> 00:02:49,000
It loves flying around and scaring everyone!

59
00:02:51,167 --> 00:02:52,333
Boo!

60
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,333
Little Deer, are you scared?

61
00:02:58,083 --> 00:03:00,083
Hmm. I guess that one isn’t quite right.

62
00:03:00,250 --> 00:03:01,667
All right. Let’s try another one.

63
00:03:04,167 --> 00:03:06,000
May, what are you doing?

64
00:03:06,667 --> 00:03:08,500
Mom, my Halloween costume

65
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:09,917
is a great tree spirit!

66
00:03:10,833 --> 00:03:11,167
Tree!

67
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:14,750
My hair is like falling leaves. More and more leaves!

68
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:15,667
Mom, what do you think?

69
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:17,833
Very unique!

70
00:03:17,917 --> 00:03:20,083
Hmm. It still doesn’t seem special enough.

71
00:03:20,250 --> 00:03:21,833
Okay, I have another idea!

72
00:03:25,417 --> 00:03:26,833
Ta-da! This one is sure to be great!

73
00:03:26,833 --> 00:03:28,250
May, what are you doing?

74
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,833
Dad, this is my Halloween costume.

75
00:03:30,833 --> 00:03:32,417
The Time Fairy!

76
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,083
She can control time!

77
00:03:34,083 --> 00:03:36,000
Really? That’s amazing!

78
00:03:36,083 --> 00:03:37,500
Watch this! Time, slow down!

79
00:03:44,583 --> 00:03:44,917
It’s slowing down!

80
00:03:46,833 --> 00:03:49,167
Okay, now time, speed up!

81
00:03:50,083 --> 00:03:52,083
Fairy, time is going by too fast!

82
00:03:52,167 --> 00:03:53,250
Can you slow it down?

83
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:54,583
Okay! Time, stop!

84
00:03:56,833 --> 00:03:57,917
What are you doing?

85
00:04:01,250 --> 00:04:03,167
Mom, I can’t think of anything!

86
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:05,583
Everyone else’s costumes are so creative.

87
00:04:05,583 --> 00:04:08,250
Mine seem so boring.

88
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:11,083
May, you don’t have to copy anyone else.

89
00:04:11,083 --> 00:04:12,917
Just do what you like.

90
00:04:12,917 --> 00:04:15,500
That’s right. Your creativity is one of a kind.

91
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:16,083
Little Deer!

92
00:04:18,667 --> 00:04:20,417
Okay! I know what I want to do now.

93
00:04:23,583 --> 00:04:26,500
All right, children! Today is Halloween!

94
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:29,417
The costume parade is about to begin!

95
00:04:29,417 --> 00:04:32,167
All right! Let’s welcome our first performer…

96
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:33,167
Jumi Rabbit!

97
00:04:37,083 --> 00:04:38,750
I’m a good friend of Chang’e,

98
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:40,167
the Moon Rabbit!

99
00:04:41,250 --> 00:04:44,417
My moon magic makes everyone sparkle

100
00:04:44,417 --> 00:04:45,333
and makes dreams come true!

101
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:46,250
Mwah!

102
00:04:47,583 --> 00:04:50,417
Very good! That pose was perfect!

103
00:04:53,250 --> 00:04:55,917
Hello, everyone! I’m Mr. Chestnut.

104
00:04:55,917 --> 00:04:57,667
This is my favorite food.

105
00:04:57,833 --> 00:04:59,500
My greatest superpower is…

106
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:01,750
doing absolutely nothing while lying down!

107
00:05:02,917 --> 00:05:05,083
That performance was so lifelike! Nicely done!

108
00:05:10,250 --> 00:05:10,917
I’m a planet in the universe!

109
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,917
A performance that brings body, mind, and spirit together. Wonderful!

110
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:28,750
No one can see me!

111
00:05:33,083 --> 00:05:34,333
Oh, amazing!

112
00:05:34,333 --> 00:05:35,667
Chuan-Chuan really disappeared!

113
00:05:35,917 --> 00:05:36,917
Where did he go?

114
00:05:37,083 --> 00:05:38,917
And our last performer, May Deer!

115
00:05:48,167 --> 00:05:51,833
I love making new friends and bringing laughter to everyone.

116
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:55,000
I want to shine like the sun

117
00:05:56,833 --> 00:05:58,667
So warm!

118
00:05:58,667 --> 00:06:00,500
I’m so happy!

119
00:06:01,583 --> 00:06:04,167
I hope everyone can become a little sun

120
00:06:04,167 --> 00:06:07,000
and light up the world with warmth!

121
00:06:09,167 --> 00:06:10,583
That’s so like May!

122
00:06:10,583 --> 00:06:12,667
Wonderful! Everyone was so creative.

123
00:06:12,917 --> 00:06:15,750
The most important thing is learning to express yourself.

124
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,750
That’s right. Being brave enough to show who you are is what growing up is all about.

125
00:06:20,917 --> 00:06:24,167
The Halloween party is starting!
